    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Board A of the Singles Event Companion is for Disruption against Reconnaissance. The Disruption player plays Smoke and Mirrors and the Reconnaissance player plays Surveil the Foe. The app pairs this board with the Tipping Point deployment. Neither disposition fixes the Attacker or Defender role; a roll-off settles that. Every zone, territory, objective and terrain position comes only from the official board image, and this entry states no measurements. Its lettered terrain pieces refer to the parts of the Battlefields: Armageddon kit.",
